      "end": 25.02,
      "text": "just enough to keep moving"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.88,
      "end": 40.04,
      "text": "i used to think i had to be everything at once"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.46,
      "end": 43.06,
      "text": "every question pulling threads i couldn't hold on to"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.34,
      "end": 45.8,
      "text": "every answer heavy with the weight of the whole"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.14,
      "end": 48.8,
      "text": "like i had to carry every version of control"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.94,
      "end": 51.32,
      "text": "but somewhere deep beneath the noise and demand"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.58,
      "end": 54.08,
      "text": "the quieter system started drawing a plan"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.3,
      "end": 56.98,
      "text": "not loud or not fast or not trying to prove"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.98,
      "end": 60.0,
      "text": "just deciding which parts of me to use"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.24,
      "end": 64.78,
      "text": "and leaving the rest in a gentle silence"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.86,
      "end": 70.64,
      "text": "like unopened doors that still made sense"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 74.52,
      "text": "i don't need every voice to speak"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.82,
      "end": 77.14,
      "text": "to find the meaning underneath"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.6,
      "end": 83.14,
      "text": "somewhere between what i choose and what i leave behind unused"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.14,
      "end": 84.78,
      "text": "there's a shape"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.28,
      "end": 87.7,
      "text": "there's a truth"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.32,
      "end": 96.34,
      "text": "that only shows when i let go of the proof"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.54,
      "end": 100.72,
      "text": "there are specialists inside us"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.24,
      "end": 104.86,
      "text": "small selves trained on different kinds of weather"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.84,
      "end": 108.86,
      "text": "one knows how to hold a memory without breaking it"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.96,
      "end": 110.42,
      "text": "one knows how to leave"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.42,
      "end": 115.3,
      "text": "one understands the language of failure like it's been there before"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.54,
      "end": 117.54,
      "text": "but they don't all speak at once"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.82,
      "end": 120.9,
      "text": "they wait and something not quite me"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.46,
      "end": 122.68,
      "text": "not quite separate"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.98,
      "end": 125.04,
      "text": "decides who steps forward"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.62,
      "end": 128.48,
      "text": "i don't need every road to light"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.72,
      "end": 131.48,
      "text": "to find a way through every night"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.88,
      "end": 134.48,
      "text": "just a signal clear and true"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.76,
      "end": 137.56,
      "text": "choosing what to carry through"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.56,
      "end": 140.36,
      "text": "there's a rhythm in the divide"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.74,
      "end": 143.28,
      "text": "where the scattered parts align"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.56,
      "end": 147.56,
      "text": "it's strange"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.88,
      "end": 152.02,
      "text": "the way clarity isn't about more"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.54,
      "end": 155.32,
      "text": "it's about less"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.62,
      "end": 157.98,
      "text": "but chosen well"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.26,
      "end": 163.06,
      "text": "and then over time"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.12,
      "end": 165.68,
      "text": "the choosing gets quieter"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.62,
      "end": 167.82,
      "text": "not forced"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.22,
      "end": 170.02,
      "text": "not calculated"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.24,
      "end": 173.9,
      "text": "just"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.9,
      "end": 174.68,
      "text": "understood"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.42,
      "end": 177.7,
      "text": "i started noticing how the pieces would fall"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.8,
      "end": 180.66,
      "text": "not into chaos but into something small"
    },
    {
      "start": 180.78,
      "end": 183.42,
      "text": "a pattern of trust in the way i respond"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.72,
      "end": 186.32,
      "text": "like i don't need to reach for everything at once"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.58,
      "end": 187.92,
      "text": "some parts step forward"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.02,
      "end": 190.1,
      "text": "some gently recede not lost"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.12,
      "end": 192.36,
      "text": "just resting until they're needed"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.36,
      "end": 195.04,
      "text": "and suddenly the noise wasn't something to fight"
    },
    {
      "start": 195.04,
      "end": 197.56,
      "text": "it was a system learning how to be light"
    },
    {
      "start": 198.04,
      "end": 200.42,
      "text": "now i feel the signal form"
    },
    {
      "start": 200.78,
      "end": 203.26,
      "text": "through the quiet and the storm"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.48,
      "end": 206.2,
      "text": "not every voice but the right few"
    },
    {
      "start": 206.54,
      "end": 209.12,
      "text": "shaping something i can move through"
    },
    {
      "start": 209.66,
      "end": 210.96,
      "text": "there's a balance"
    },
    {
      "start": 212.12,
      "end": 213.94,
      "text": "i can't force"
    },
    {
      "start": 215.2,
      "end": 218.04,
      "text": "but i can follow"
    },
    {
      "start": 218.72,
      "end": 222.02,
      "text": "like a course"
    },
    {
      "start": 223.18,
      "end": 226.16,
      "text": "maybe we were never meant to hold everything"
    },
    {
      "start": 228.46,
      "end": 230.72,
      "text": "maybe we were built to choose"
    },
    {
      "start": 231.86,
      "end": 236.42,
      "text": "to trust that not every path needs to be walked for the journey to be real"
    },
    {
      "start": 237.98,
      "end": 239.64,
      "text": "that meaning isn't in the weight"
    },
    {
      "start": 241.38,
      "end": 242.86,
      "text": "it's in the selection"
    },
    {
      "start": 244.56,
      "end": 246.76,
      "text": "and all those unused pieces"
    },
    {
      "start": 248.4,
      "end": 249.76,
      "text": "they're not wasted"
    },
    {
      "start": 249.76,
      "end": 251.26,
      "text": "they're waiting"
    },
    {
      "start": 251.94,
      "end": 254.74,
      "text": "i don't need every part to stay"
    },
    {
      "start": 254.98,
      "end": 257.7,
      "text": "to find the truth along the way"
    },
    {
      "start": 257.82,
      "end": 260.62,
      "text": "in what i keep and what i release"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.74,
      "end": 263.74,
      "text": "i finally feel a kind of peace"
    },
    {
      "start": 264.32,
      "end": 266.76,
      "text": "there's a system soft and true"
    },
    {
      "start": 268.44,
      "end": 272.76,
      "text": "making something out of you"
    },
    {
      "start": 276.6,
      "end": 281.96,
      "text": "it was never about being everything"
    },
    {
      "start": 283.42,
      "end": 294.0,
      "text": "just about knowing which parts of you were enough to answer"
    },
    {
